# The image is built from the Go module and nothing else: the Dockerfile does
# `COPY ./sim .`. Everything outside sim is excluded so it is not uploaded to the
# Docker daemon on every build, which otherwise means sending the whole git
# history and the duel interface package for an image that uses neither.
#
# If the Dockerfile ever needs more than sim, add it as another exception here.
*
!sim

# Developer files that live inside sim. The multi-stage build already keeps these
# out of the final image, which only receives the build directory, but they have
# no business being uploaded or landing in the build cache either.
sim/.env*
sim/**/__debug_*
